{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04256","headline":"西行别东台详正学士 · 骆宾王","name":"西行别东台详正学士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"意气坐相亲，关河别故人。\n客似秦川上，歌疑易水滨。\n塞荒行辨玉，台远尚名轮。\n泄井怀边将，寻源重汉臣。\n上苑梅花早，御沟杨柳新。\n只应持此曲，别作边城春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04256.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04256","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}